    {
      "id": "claim_bd6d3fd3e87d4e699ac6dc469c0986d3",
      "statement": "CacheKey.localKey() is the key for file-based caches and log output: it is a deterministic UUID derived from the cached content only (KeyGenerator.generateKey = nameUUIDFromBytes over CRLF-normalized UTF-8 content, set by ChatCacheKey.of and EmbeddingCacheKey.of), and LocalCache stores, looks up, and checks entries under it — so identical content always maps to the same entry within a cache file.",
      "evidence": [
