      "id": "claim_1e1f40a52976431c92591b6f1f380365",
      "statement": "LargeLanguageModelCacheMode (EMBEDDING, CHAT) is a serialized field of every concrete CacheKey — ChatCacheKey always sets CHAT and EmbeddingCacheKey always sets EMBEDDING — so a chat entry and an embedding entry for the same model and content serialize to different keys and can never collide in Redis or in local files.",
