      "id": "claim_0c6a6a24ce584a06bf8709a6f69b85dc",
      "statement": "CacheTest covers local persistence and backward compatibility: each test resets the CacheManager default instance with a MapEnvironment (CACHE_HIERARCHY=LOCAL, CACHE_REPLACEMENT_STRATEGY=ERROR) and builds a LocalCache directly over a @TempDir file via local TestCacheKey/TestCacheParameter helpers; testBackwardCompatibility copies the legacy fixture src/test/resources/cache/test-local-cache-sample.json (content-UUID keys mapped to plain unserialized string values) and reads all three entries — the exact path where Cache.convert's String fallback applies. Run with mvn -q test -Dtest=CacheTest.",
